{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Naiads' Fall</i> is a side-scrolling pixel action RPG. When the blood-tears of Naiads saturate the land, you will enter a realm torn by divine retribution\u2014a world where every grain of sand bears the curse of decadence, and every raindrop holds the power to slay gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648390/extras/copy_D0FA6264-5381-4509-A3BD-730B375E51A0.gif?t=1744722178\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experience</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awaken in the <i>Fallen Dominion</i>, a forsaken expanse of mystery and wonder. Explore enchanted forests, cryptic ruins, and fantastical uncharted territories... Through relentless combat and exploration, acquire legendary relics to forge your ultimate combat system and unearth the secrets of this broken world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648390/extras/copy_1766D69F-AB59-499B-A4EE-390F5B0CD324.gif?t=1744722178\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong>\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel-perfect character customization with diverse equipment variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adaptive combat mechanics and modular gear systems for endless build diversity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized loot drops with unique combat applications</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free-form class system to craft unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi-themed battlegrounds with shifting environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic enemy factions and NPC factions shaping the world's fate</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648390/extras/copy_4EB98C7E-3FA3-41AC-9C79-F6B5B4392A4A.gif?t=1744722178\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648390?t=1744722178","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648390?t=1744722178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648390/344c311c9db5a6e2363e6c98505e9bdee6ad1c0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744722178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648390/344c311c9db5a6e2363e6c98505e9bdee6ad1c0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744722178","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be suitable for work environments: Includes depictions of mature themes."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Naiads' Fall</i> is a side-scrolling pixel action RPG. When the blood-tears of Naiads saturate the land, you will enter a realm torn by divine retribution\u2014a world where every grain of sand bears the curse of decadence, and every raindrop holds the power to slay gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648390/extras/copy_D0FA6264-5381-4509-A3BD-730B375E51A0.gif?t=1744722178\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experience</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awaken in the <i>Fallen Dominion</i>, a forsaken expanse of mystery and wonder. Explore enchanted forests, cry